  "reason": "Policy change SCMOS-AI-PC-2026-10-14 (14 Oct 2026), option A of the bounds proposal for the five unbounded agents: none of them is bounded or enabled, and the two scheduled passes lose their grants. Measured on Production: the Communication pass drafted 995 carrier messages between 29 Sep and 3 Oct and every one was answered not-sent; its chat ran twice (21 Sep tests); the Booking agent never ran and its mail source (Outlook) was dropped; rate, incident and compliance have no tool. Removed: scan_communication and the CommunicationDraft grant from communication-agent, scan_booking from booking-agent, and the system-pass data scope from both. Nothing granted, no budget, owner or isolation acceptance changed; the nine bounded agents and SCMOS-AI-RR-2026-10-05 are untouched.",
